#: src/main.c
msgid "STARTED FROM THE CONSOLE"
msgstr "GESTART VIA DE CONSOLE"

#: src/main.c
msgid "Enigma2 is stopped"
msgstr "Enigma2 is gestopt"

#: src/main.c
msgid ""
"Recovery Manager runs from a console session. After it ends, Enigma2 can be "
"started again with init 3."
msgstr ""
"Recovery Manager wordt uitgevoerd vanuit een console sessie. Na het "
"afsluiten kan Enigma2 opnieuw worden gestart met init 3."

#: src/main.c
msgid "OPENED FROM THE MENU"
msgstr "VANUIT HET MENU GEOPEND"

#: src/main.c
msgid "Enigma2 is paused"
msgstr "Enigma2 is gepauzeerd"

#: src/main.c
msgid ""
"Recovery Manager was opened from the menu. After it ends, Enigma2 starts "
"again on its own."
msgstr ""
"Recovery Manager is geopend vanuit het menu. Na het afsluiten start Enigma2 "
"automatisch opnieuw."

